13. Tests

Test these scenarios without running a broad Splunk search:

- Normal Edge is already open.
- Authentication state is valid.
- Authentication state is expired.
- Authentication file is missing.
- Dedicated authentication profile is already open.
- Two search workers start simultaneously.
- A stale application lock exists.
- A normal unrelated Edge process exists.
- Cleanup runs after an exception.

Confirm that no test closes or disrupts normal Edge.

